<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Capacuan 5-ha MB block on T-2194 (Senen parcel) + Lot 4 P-1616</name><Style id="v7"><LineStyle><color>ff00ff00</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>3300ff00</color></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="sen"><LineStyle><color>ffff8800</color><width>2.5</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>22ff8800</color></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="v5"><LineStyle><color>44ffffff</color><width>1</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>00ffffff</color></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="mon"><IconStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><scale>1.3</scale></IconStyle></Style><Style id="tie"><LineStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><width>2</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="blk"><LineStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>440000ff</color></PolyStyle></Style><Placemark><name>MB block 5.1816 ha - PRS92 (official datum)</name><styleUrl>#blk</styleUrl><description>Corners 14 15 07.5-15.0 N, 122 42 30.0-37.5 E per Kapasyahan 18 s-2021 / 2026 refiling, read in PRS92 (EO 45 s.1993; DAO 2005-13) and transformed to WGS84 (EPSG:4683 to 4326). Shift ~+147 m E, -160 m N vs a literal WGS84 reading. Falls 100% inside T-2194.</description><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>122.709698,14.250640,0 122.709698,14.252723,0 122.711781,14.252723,0 122.711781,14.250640,0 122.709698,14.250640,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5-ha block - numbers read as WGS84 (WRONG reading, reference only)</name><styleUrl>#v5</styleUrl><description>Corners exactly as written in Brgy. Capacuan Kapasyahan 18 s-2021 / 64 s-2024 and the CSSMA 9 Jun 2026 refiling: 14 15 07.5-15.0 N, 122 42 30.0-37.5 E. Overlaid on the mapped T-2194 / Senen 2012 parcel: ~2.74 ha of the block lies inside T-2194 (53% of the block); the rest spills W/N off the title because a meridional grid block cannot follow lot lines. No overlap with Lot 4 P-1616. Block datum unstated - PENDING VERIFICATION; T-2194 position +/-20-30 m.</description><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>122.708333,14.252083,0 122.708333,14.254167,0 122.710417,14.254167,0 122.710417,14.252083,0 122.708333,14.252083,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark><Placemark><name>Lot 4 Psu-143364 — OCT P-1616 (v7)</name><styleUrl>#v7</styleUrl>
<description>Lot 4, Psu-143364 — OCT P-1616 (Allan V. Inocalla), 152,069 sqm. POSITION v7 — TIE LINE OFFICIALLY CONFIRMED BY DENR: SMD R-V letter Ref. SMD-SCS-INC-26-172 (Sept 22, 2026) states the tie line of Lot 4, Psu-143364 is N 60°01' W, 3,508.83 m from BLBM No. 1, Bo. Batobalani, Paracale — the exact bearing this map uses. Corner 1 = monument (DENR CN tie-point table id 52589, datum proven Luzon/PRS92 by 0.00 m PTM round-trip) + confirmed tie line. Independently cross-validated by the 2012 Senen Inocalla mining-plan interlock (0.1-0.2 m agreement). Est. accuracy ±20-30 m absolute (datum transform + table fidelity); relative geometry decimeter-grade. Closure 0.07 m, area 152,068.9 sqm. Remaining refinement only: official GPPC Certification coordinates (pending fee/release) will tighten ±20-30 m absolute to survey grade.</description>
<Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>122.711924,14.249210,0 122.712017,14.250592,0 122.712577,14.248476,0 122.714503,14.247727,0 122.712449,14.245912,0 122.710968,14.246198,0 122.709553,14.245439,0 122.709333,14.247186,0 122.708962,14.247894,0 122.708599,14.247975,0 122.708093,14.247815,0 122.708028,14.248495,0 122.709930,14.248490,0 122.710740,14.249009,0 122.711930,14.248575,0 122.711924,14.249210,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark><Placemark><name>Senen V. Inocalla parcel (2012 mining-permit plan)</name><styleUrl>#sen</styleUrl>
<description>Senen Villafria Inocalla parcel — Sketch Plan of Small Scale Mining Permit Application &amp; Topographic Survey (Jan 27, 2012, GE Jose Mari P. Ayton), Brgy. Capacuan, Paracale, 133,690 sqm (computed 133,700, closure 0.09 m; boundary course 11-12 corrected to S64°48'W from scan misread S84°48'W). Tie N.57°49'W 3,579.00 m from BLLM/BLBM No. 1 Batobalane. Adjoins Lot 4 Psu-143364 (shared boundary confirmed 0.1-0.2 m), Lot 1 Psu-143364, Merquiades Lamadrid (N), public land (S), creek (E). Topo survey area 42,972 sqm within. MINERAL-PROOF EXHIBIT: family small-scale mining permit application on land adjoining Lot 4.</description>
